Error [E0925]: `#Every(…)` needs `#Job` on the same function
  --> tests/ui/schedule_every_without_task.jet:2:1
    |
  2 | #Every(5min)
    | ^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: a schedule only means something on a task — `#Every(…)` names when `#Job` runs, it isn't a standalone timer.
 Fix: add `#Job` (`#Job #Every(5min) fn …`), or drop `#Every(…)` if this isn't a scheduled task.
